	(text "Bus-powered: VREGIN from VBUS, VBUS sense pin via 22.1k/47.5k, VDD = internal 3.3 V regulator output, VIO tied to VDD, 4.7uF + 100nF per power pin.\nProgram the USB product string 'Pager' with Simplicity Studio Xpress Configurator after assembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112.522 249.428 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35879ae3-3900-5946-a10a-d84e0692c744")
	)
	(text "Q2/Q3 are the two halves of one UMH3N (Q2A/Q2B); the brief's Q3 is Q2B. The Walter already pulls EN up (10k); IO0 has only the ESP32 internal pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.55 225.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68527e21-5483-503f-a4e0-12093654d4b4")
	)
	(text "Auto-reset (Espressif): Q2 DTR->EN, Q3 RTS->IO0. JP1 (closed) in Q3's collector lets auto-boot be disabled; reset still works."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.55 140.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bb5aeff7-f797-57b6-9ae2-9ee1607bb012")
	)
	(text "USB-serial bridge: bus-powered CP2102N (unpowered without a cable)\nSN74LVC2G126 isolates UART0 when VBUS_DET is low\nEspressif two-transistor auto-reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c48f8698-f995-59c9-9a29-d49e5e655a5d")
	)
	(text "U6 SN74LVC2G126: both OE from VBUS_DET. A: ESP_TX0 -> BRG_RXD. B: BRG_TXD -> ESP_RX0. 10k keeps ESP_RX0 high with no cable.\nU6 VCC is BRG_3V3 (bus-powered): with no cable the buffer is unpowered (Ioff outputs), so no LVC quiescent/float current on the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ed244774-9cb8-535e-8629-9d86c9e306b4")
	)
